==Battleground==
*1 [[Easter Duche]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Golden Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cats]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Easter B.B.Bunny|Easter B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Gary Gory]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Red Slug]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Black Slug]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Slug]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage may appear difficult at first glance, especially with the presence of the slugs. However, it is possible to rush down the base quickly with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]], as Easter Duche does not deal a lot of damage, and is simply a tank with 300k hp. If you have other rushers, this is certainly the stage to run it with.

If you don't have rushers, don't fear, as while the slugs may appear threatening, only the Angel Slug is—but even the speed/attack rate of the Angel Slug is so slow, so you'll be able to handle it with ease. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] in particular outranges it by over 150 range.

